message: "If you use MicroFit Pro, please cite the accompanying paper and this software record."
title: "MicroFit Pro: A Web-Based Platform for Predictive Microbial Inactivation Modeling and Sensitivity Analysis Across Processing Technologies"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-04-28"
license: "MIT"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MicroFit Pro contributors"
abstract: "MicroFit Pro is a browser-executed platform for microbial inactivation model fitting, secondary environmental modeling, dynamic simulation, uncertainty propagation, and sensitivity analysis across thermal and non-thermal processing technologies."
keywords:
  - microbial inactivation
  - predictive microbiology
  - secondary models
  - uncertainty analysis
  - sensitivity analysis
